  "_comment": [
    "Real GitHub Actions job timings for 2AMLogic/klayout-tools `ci.yml`, captured",
    "2026-09-29 for issue #2615 and reduced to job-name -> seconds. Provenance:",
    "  gh api repos/2AMLogic/klayout-tools/actions/runs/<run_id>/jobs?per_page=100",
    "  gh api repos/2AMLogic/klayout-tools/actions/workflows/323419028/runs",
    "Seconds are completed_at - started_at for every job whose conclusion carries a",
    "duration (skipped/cancelled/neutral dropped), exactly as the check measures them.",
    "These are not synthesised: they are the runs issue #2615 cites as evidence, so",
    "tests/test_ci_wall_clock.py can replay the real contention episodes and the real",
    "whole-matrix slowdown rather than asserting against invented numbers.",
    "",
    "Groups:",
    "  baseline_main_before_2026_09_24 -- the 9 usable main runs preceding the",
    "    regression run below; the rolling window it would actually have been judged",
    "    against.",
    "  regression_main_2026_09_24 -- run 36003284901, all four Tests legs at",
    "    724-816s against a ~310-334s baseline, with NO overlapping run. The",
    "    genuine-whole-matrix-slowdown case that must still fail.",
    "  baseline_main_2026_09_26_to_29 -- the 15 main runs preceding the 2026-09-29",
    "    contention episodes.",
    "  contention_2026_09_29_1939 -- the four concurrent runs on four unrelated",
    "    branches whose every leg landed at 849-1247s. Must NOT fail.",
    "  contention_2026_09_29_1709 -- the earlier, milder episode (worst legs",
    "    996/824/664/537s). Must NOT fail.",
    "  uncorroborated_main_2026_09_29_1823 -- run 36611724105 (a Loom-surfaces",
    "    resync commit, i.e. no compute change at all) whose legs ran 422-809s with",
    "    no overlapping ci.yml run to prove the pool was busy. The documented",
    "    residual false positive, and the case the same-commit re-run corroboration",
    "    rule exists to absorb."
